The letters is "bbbab".
The last is the last position of letters.
The width is last plus 1.
The table is a list of 25 zeros.
For every spot from 0 to last.
Set item (spot times width plus spot) of table to 1.

For every span from 2 to width.
For every begin from 0 to width minus span.
The tail is begin plus span minus 1.
The belowrow is begin plus 1.
The beforecolumn is tail minus 1.
The cell is begin times width plus tail.
The insidecell is belowrow times width plus beforecolumn.
The inside is item insidecell of table.
The withinside is inside plus 2.
The dropfirstcell is belowrow times width plus tail.
The droplastcell is begin times width plus beforecolumn.
The dropfirst is item dropfirstcell of table.
The droplast is item droplastcell of table.
The better is the larger of dropfirst and droplast.
If the slice of letters from begin to begin plus 1 matches the slice of letters from tail to tail plus 1, set item cell of table to withinside, otherwise set item cell of table to better.

The answer is item (width minus 1) of table.
